{"id":"b7d7a03ff76428de","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-robinson-arithmetic.md","title":"Robinson Arithmetic","display":"df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic","aliases":["90-df-robinson-arithmetic"],"display":"df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-robinson-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S,+,\\times\">\\(0,S,+,\\times\\)</span> (arithmetic-language symbols, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}\\)</span> (first-order calculus with equality, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 为两个不同个体变量；下式量词是对象语言构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\ne t\">\\(s\\ne t\\)</span> 展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(s=t)\">\\(\\neg(s=t)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pres}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pres}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> 中的呈示对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_{\\mathrm{ax}}\">\\(Q_{\\mathrm{ax}}\\)</span> 为显式的句子公理集视图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}arithmetic}\\ \\vdash\\\nQ\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})+\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall x\\;Sx\\neq0,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\;(Sx=Sy\\rightarrow x=y),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;(x\\neq0\\rightarrow\\exists y\\;x=Sy),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;x+0=x,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\;x+Sy=S(x+y),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;x\\times0=0,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\;x\\times Sy=(x\\times y)+x\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}arithmetic}\\ \\vdash\\\nQ\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})+\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall x\\;Sx\\neq0,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\;(Sx=Sy\\rightarrow x=y),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;(x\\neq0\\rightarrow\\exists y\\;x=Sy),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;x+0=x,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\;x+Sy=S(x+y),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;x\\times0=0,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\;x\\times Sy=(x\\times y)+x\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_{\\mathrm{ax}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ax}(Q),\\qquad\nQ\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}},\\qquad Q_{\\mathrm{ax}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_{\\mathrm{ax}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ax}(Q),\\qquad\nQ\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}},\\qquad Q_{\\mathrm{ax}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 是标准的有限公理化弱算术基底；“最弱”必须相对于具体解释性或表示性准则说明，不能作为无条件定义事实。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 缺少归纳公理模式</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a> — 算术语言</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4c3a40ac2277e7d0\" href=\"?note=4c3a40ac2277e7d0\" title=\"90-df-peano-arithmetic\">90-df-peano-arithmetic</a> — Peano 算术</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[